From a8c7fa4a4c6f7a3a1f97581a68ce7f14d7a8ee2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wolfgang Beyer <wolfi@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 04:37:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 17/32] [extensions] Block debugger attachment to inner PDF
 frames

ExtensionMayAttachToRenderFrameHost previously skipped
MimeHandlerViewGuest and OOPIF PDF extension frames unconditionally,
even when the PDF frame itself was the root target being checked. It
also did not reject direct attachment to the inner PDF content frame
(rfh->GetProcess()->IsPdf()).

Only skip MimeHandlerViewGuest and OOPIF PDF extension frames (and
their children) when checking an ancestor frame (rfh !=
render_frame_host), and reject direct attachment to PDF content frames.

